# Static Files[¶](https://flask.palletsprojects.com/en/stable/tutorial/static/#static-files "Link to this heading")
The authentication views and templates work, but they look very plain right now. Some _static_ file rather than a template.
Flask automatically adds a `static` view that takes a path relative to the `flaskr/static` directory and serves it. The `base.html` template already has a link to the `style.css` file:
```
{{ url_for('static', filename='style.css') }}

```

